    "之后上传到此文件夹（及未单独设置的子文件夹）的文件将保存到所选策略。已有文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files uploaded to this folder (and subfolders without their own policy) will be stored with the selected policy. Existing files are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之后上传到此文件夹（及未单独设置的子文件夹）的文件将保存到所选策略。已有文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
