    "以下项目正被其他操作占用。强制解锁可能导致对方的修改丢失。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The following items are in use by another operation. Forcing an unlock may discard their changes."
